# Customer Behavior & Transaction Analytics – End-to-End Data Analytics Project

## 📌 Project Overview

This project demonstrates an **end-to-end data analytics workflow** for processing and analyzing customer, policy, transaction, and application log data.

The objective is to transform **raw multi-source datasets** into structured, analysis-ready datasets through:

* Data Profiling
* Data Cleaning
* Data Quality Validation
* Feature Engineering
* Data Aggregation
* Customer-Level Analytics
* Log Analytics
* Star Schema Data Modeling

The final output is a consolidated customer analytics dataset containing financial metrics, transaction behavior, risk indicators, and log-derived insights.

---

## 🎯 Project Objectives

* Profile raw datasets from multiple formats
* Clean and standardize customer, policy, transaction, and log data
* Handle missing values and duplicates
* Perform feature engineering
* Parse semi-structured logs
* Generate customer-level analytical metrics
* Create a dimensional data model
* Export cleaned analytical datasets

