## 🚀 Project Outcome

The project demonstrates a complete **data analytics pipeline** starting from raw multi-source data and progressing through:

```text
Data Ingestion
      ↓
Data Profiling
      ↓
Data Cleaning
      ↓
Feature Engineering
      ↓
Transaction Aggregation
      ↓
Log Analytics
      ↓
Customer-Level Dataset
      ↓
Data Modeling
```

The resulting structured dataset can support further analysis, reporting, visualization, and business intelligence use cases.

